Recover the aligned core by

$$
 y_i=x_{i-I_{s_D}+1}\qquad(i\in\mathbb Z/p\mathbb Z),
 \tag{PCR.14}
$$

and iterate (PCR.6) backwards to obtain both initial residues.
For $p=1$, the two phases and all residues are zero; (PCR.14) still
